flowchart TD
Start["**Start MOO Run**<br/>User triggers optimization"] 
RunNSGA2["**run_nsga2_optimization**<br/>Configures problem algorithm and termination"] 
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes n_var n_obj n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Method _evaluate performs parallel fitness evaluation"] 
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Sampling crossover mutation eliminate duplicates<br/>Maintains population and history"] 
Population["**Population**<br/>Collection of candidate solutions of size pop_size<br/>Decision variables are buffer capacities {1-10}"] 
EvaluateIndividuals["**Evaluate Individuals**<br/>Create evaluation tasks for each candidate<br/>Each task contains caps and replication settings"] 
MultiprocessingPool["**Parallel Evaluator**<br/>Uses multiprocessing Pool with exactly n_cores processes<br/>Maps tasks to worker processes"] 
EvaluateSingle["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Runs n_replications of simulation per candidate<br/>Aggregates average throughput and average wip"] 
RunSimMOO["**run_simulation_moo**<br/>Builds simpy environment using caps for DelayBuffer capacities<br/>Performs warmup sampling and measurement"] 
SimComponents["**Simulation Components**<br/>Creates DelayBuffer and Machine instances and part generator<br/>Samples WIP and records produced parts"] 
DelayBufferNode["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"] 
MachineNode["**Machine**<br/>Attributes working_time failed_time_total wait_input_time blocked_time processed_count active_count is_up<br/>Methods run waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption reset_machine_stats"] 
ComputeObjectives["**Compute Objectives**<br/>Compute throughput and avg wip from simulation results<br/>Return objectives as [wip negative_throughput] for minimizer"] 
CollectResults["**Collect Results**<br/>Parallel evaluator gathers per candidate fitness vectors<br/>Returns results to BufferCapacityProblem _evaluate"] 
UpdatePopulation["**Update Population**<br/>NSGA2 uses fitness to perform selection crossover mutation<br/>Generates next generation and appends to history"] 
SaveHistory["**Save History**<br/>Algorithm stores population X F CV each generation<br/>History used for export and analysis"] 
ExportHistory["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Iterates history generations and writes feasible solutions to CSV<br/>Records decision variables and KPIs"] 
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and results exported"] 

Start --> RunNSGA2
RunNSGA2 --> BufferProblem
RunNSGA2 --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Population
Population --> EvaluateIndividuals
EvaluateIndividuals --> MultiprocessingPool
MultiprocessingPool --> EvaluateSingle
EvaluateSingle --> RunSimMOO
RunSimMOO --> SimComponents
SimComponents --> DelayBufferNode
SimComponents --> MachineNode
DelayBufferNode --> RunSimMOO
MachineNode --> RunSimMOO
RunSimMOO --> ComputeObjectives
ComputeObjectives --> EvaluateSingle
EvaluateSingle --> CollectResults
CollectResults --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> UpdatePopulation
UpdatePopulation --> SaveHistory
SaveHistory --> ExportHistory
ExportHistory --> End